---
import SocialLinks from "./SocialLinks.astro";
---

<section id="top" class="pt-12 sm:pt-16">
  <h1 class="reveal reveal-1 text-[1.7rem] leading-[1.2] sm:text-[2rem]">
    hi, i'm elsa.
  </h1>

  <div
    class="reveal reveal-2 body mt-6 max-w-[40rem] space-y-4 text-[1.08rem] text-muted"
  >
    <p>
      20, dropped out of usc — not to "chase my dreams," exactly, but to chase a
      kind of freedom i've always wanted.
    </p>
    <p>
      currently head of growth & creative director @<a
        href="https://ditto.ai"
        class="link-accent"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">ditto</a
      >, a consumer social + matchmaking app for college students like me.
    </p>
    <p>
      about a year in, no startups before this. i just think the next operating
      system for getting things done gets built around conversation — with ai
      agents as the execution layer.
    </p>
    <p>
      started on the creative side, then drifted into execution, strategy,
      building. i don't really believe in lanes — i'd rather stay fluid and sit
      at the intersection, wherever the most interesting things are happening.
    </p>
  </div>

  <SocialLinks class="reveal reveal-3 mt-7" />
</section>
